      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "UL realized / RX cap",
      "description": "Realized / cap × 100. Lines at 90 % and 110 % are the README §8 ±10 % band. Only meaningful while the UE offers more than its cap (e.g. iperf3 running); idle UEs sit near 0 %. UEs with cap 0 (TX: killswitch, RX: uncapped) are excluded instead of dividing by 0. Bytes are L2 frame bytes (Ethernet header included), the same unit the cap is enforced in (contract X3 option B), so realized ≈ cap; iperf3 goodput is a few % lower (L2/L3/L4 headers). ",
